{"segs": ["PA_ja_116:0.2", "PA_ja_116:0.3"], "en": "Ekakanipāta, Haṃsivagga (The Section on the Swan)", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_116:0.4"], "en": "6. The Dubbaca-jātaka:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_116:1.1", "PA_ja_116:1.2"], "en": "\"O teacher who does what is excessive, even this is not pleasing to me.\"", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_116:1.3"], "en": "\"In the fourth [life], having leaped over,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_116:1.4"], "en": "he was caught in the fifth iron [wheel].", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_116:2.1"], "en": "Thus ends the sixth Jātaka, the Duvaca-jātaka.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"}
